From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:47:36 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 35/39] Meridian: profiles per space (own cookies, frame
 windows, Arc profiles) and the Downloads popover
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Spaces can live in their own Chromium profile: switching to one shows that
profile's window in place of the current one; all share one sidebar model.
Arc profiles import into "Meridian Profile Arc N" with their favorites and
sign-ins. The sidebar gets a Downloads popover (⇧⌘J) with progress, cancel,
open, reveal, keep/discard; closing what would cancel downloads asks first.
Fixes a crash when a tab closes before its guest is attached (downloads).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
